      "text": "To launch a lot of rockets, you need to build a lot of rockets.\n\nOur factory is currently producing Electron at a rate of one rocket every 8 days.\n\nFrom single layers of carbon composite, to firing 3D-printed Rutherford engines multiple times before flight - every step requires precision and paranoia.\n\nThis is Electron's journey from production to the pad.",
