      "text": "Wet Dress Rehearsal complete ✅ \n\nElectron is ready for its 100th launch this weekend from Launch Complex 1.\n\n'The Mountain God Rises' launch window opens tomorrow Nov 14:\n🚀6:30pm NZDT\n🚀2:30 pm JST\n🚀05:30 UTC\n🚀12:30 am ET\n🚀9:30 pm PT (Nov 13)",
