      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Rocket Lab’s avionics are up and running on @NASARoman.\n\nOur hardware is enabling Roman's coronagraph instrument, the system that blocks starlight to directly image planets orbiting distant stars.\n\nNext stop: first images!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "NASARoman",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1263147701753044993/27RMFMi7_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-23 04:21:36",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-22T20:21:36.000Z",
        "id": "2113365173201199563",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113365126807990273/img/blxel9EgwRZmzvk1.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 28.328,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113365126807990273/img/blxel9EgwRZmzvk1.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113365126807990273/vid/avc1/1920x1080/CAzcLdw9yUPNg6B_.mp4?tag=16",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope",
        "text": "It's the final countdown 🎶\n\nWe're one step closer to Roman's first images! The observatory is now fully functional and the team is performing their final checks and calibrations before starting science observations.\n\nhttps://go.nasa.gov/4A9menV",
        "url": "https://x.com/NASARoman/status/2113365173201199563",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "government"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
